My sound will randomly quit. The levels (in alsamixer) remain unchanged and
the speakers do not get muted, however there is no sound. The only way I
can hear sound again is to reload the module "snd_hda_intel". No errors are
logged anywhere I thought to check. I have attached the output of the
information script that I found on alsa-project.org.

I was told to write this email by nevyn in #alsa on Freenode.

Please let me know if you need any more information.

